dney Harbour</h1>\n        <!-- Film Details -->\n        <div class=\"inner-content-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"details-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"info-section\">\n                    <div class=\"poster-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"poster\">\n                                                        <img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"/imgs/posters/large/turandot.jpg\" alt=\"Turandot on Sydney Harbour\" title=\"Turandot on Sydney Harbour\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"info\">\n                        <p><b>Format:</b> 2D Digital\n                                                    </p>\n                        <p><b>Genre:</b> Opera</p>\n                        <p><b>Running Time:</b> 2 hours 26 minutes</p>\n                        <p><b>Rate:</b> PG<br /></p>\n                        <br />\n                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i> Free List Suspended</p>                        <p><i class=\"fa fa-wheelchair\"></i> Wheelchair/Disabled Access</p>                                                <p class=\"more-info\">For more cinema access information <br class=\"show-on-ip\"><a href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/cinema/access\">click here</a>.\n                        <meta itemprop=\"dateCreated\" content=\"01-01-1970\">\n                    </div>\n\n                </div><!-- end of poster -->\n                <div class=\"content\">\n                    <!-- synopsis -->\n                                        <div class=\"synopsis\">\n                        <h3>Turandot on Sydney Harbour Synopsis</h3>\n                        <p itemprop=\"description\">Turandot on Sydney Harbour<br />\r\nThis Handa Opera on Sydney Harbour production, directed by Chen Shi-Zheng, is known for its<br />\r\nlavish sets, including a 25-meter dragon and a 20-meter pagoda, and its use of contemporary<br />\r\ncinema and Chinese acrobatics. The production features a cast of world-class singers, including<br />\r\nDragana Radakovic as Turandot and Riccardo Massi as Calaf, and is known for its powerful<br />\r\nrendition of “Nessun Dorma”.</p>\n                                                                    </div><!-- end of synopsis -->\n                                        <a name=\"watchwithbaby\" id=\"watchwithbaby\"></a>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Book Tickets -->\n                                        <div class=\"book-tickets\">\n        <h3>Book Tickets</h3>\n    <div class=\"book-tickets-listings\">\n\n                        <div class=\"date-wrapper\">\n            <p class=\"ticket-date\">Wednesday 5th August 2026</p>\n            <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n                                                <a class=\"btn btn-info\" onclick=\"gtag('event', 'click', {'event_category' :'book tickets', 'event_label': 'Turandot on Sydney Harbour : Wednesday 5th August 2026 at 19:45'})\" href=\"https://ticketing.eu.veezi.com/purchase/80789?siteToken=zkD3Bh7H%2fkuZI9VTgCj%2bgg%3d%3d\" target=\"_blank\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-05T19:45\">19:45</time></a>\n                                            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        \n        \n    </div>\n    <br />\n</div><!-- end of book-tickets -->                                                            <!-- Book Tickets -->\n\n                    <!-- Cast Crew -->\n                                        <!-- end of Cast Crew -->\n\n                    <br />\n                    <!-- Social Sharing -->\n<div class=\"social-share-wrapper\">\n        <!-- Facebook -->\n        <div class=\"fb-share-button\" data-href=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/turandot\" data-layout=\"button\"></div>\n        <!-- Twitter -->\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/share\" \n            class=\"twitter-share-button\" \n            data-url=\"https://www.peckhamplex.london/film/turandot\" \n            data-text=