escription\">In the final film of The Strangers trilogy, Maya (Madelaine Petsch) faces the masked killers one last time in a brutal, full-circle reckoning of survival and revenge.</p>\n                                                                    </div><!-- end of synopsis -->\n                                        <a name=\"watchwithbaby\" id=\"watchwithbaby\"></a>\n\n                    \n                    <!-- Book Tickets -->\n                                        <p>There are currently no dates/times available for this film.</p>\n                                                            <!-- Book Tickets -->\n\n                    <!-- Cast Crew -->\n                                        <div class=\"cast-crew\">\n\t<h3>Cast &amp; Crew</h3>\n\t<!-- Directors -->\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-wrapper\">\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-title\">\n\t\t\t Director \t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-names\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cast-crew-names\" itemprop=\"director\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n\t\t\t\t<span itemprop=\"name\">Renny Harlin</span>\n\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t<br /> \t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- Actors -->\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-wrapper\">\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-title\">\n\t\t\t Actors \t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"cast-crew-names\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cast-crew-names\" itemprop=\"actors\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n\t\t\t\t<span itemprop=\"name\">Richard Brake</span>\n\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t<br /> \t\t\t<span class=\"cast-crew-names\" itemprop=\"actors\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n\t\t\t\t<span itemprop=\"name\">Gabriel Basso</span>\n\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t<br /> \t\t\t<span class=\"cast-crew-names\" itemprop=\"actors\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n\t\t\t\t<span itemprop=\"name\">Ema Horvath</span>\n\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t<br /> \t\t\t<span class=\"cast-crew-names\" itemprop=\"actors\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n\t\